WEBVTT

00:34.880 --> 00:35.670
Hurry up!

00:35.840 --> 00:36.640
On my way!

00:37.150 --> 00:37.710
Let's go.

00:38.280 --> 00:39.080
Go take a look.

00:43.640 --> 00:44.390
See?

00:46.070 --> 00:47.800
Look! They're going upstream!

00:49.030 --> 00:50.000
Aren't they going backwards?

00:50.000 --> 00:50.430
Look!

00:51.470 --> 00:52.130
Over there!

01:03.200 --> 01:03.840
Jialiang!

01:05.000 --> 01:05.640
Jiashu!

01:09.150 --> 01:09.760
Jialiang!

01:10.400 --> 01:11.039
Jiashu!

01:11.789 --> 01:12.430
Jiashu!

01:12.840 --> 01:13.530
Jialiang!

01:14.200 --> 01:14.810
Jiashu!

01:14.950 --> 01:16.760
The immortal children descend.

01:17.010 --> 01:19.120
Against the current, the corpses go.

01:26.789 --> 01:27.560
Jialiang!

01:31.400 --> 01:32.039
Brother.

01:44.509 --> 01:45.350
Stepmother?

01:46.150 --> 01:47.400
Your father is dead.

01:49.229 --> 01:51.030
Your younger brother and sister

01:52.590 --> 01:53.920
are also dead.

01:58.789 --> 01:59.479
No...

02:01.590 --> 02:02.310
Feiyan...

02:03.840 --> 02:04.640
Feiyan.

02:05.350 --> 02:07.410
I need to get an explanation from her.

02:09.240 --> 02:11.000
Scam!

02:13.080 --> 02:15.240
The whole thing is a scam!

02:15.260 --> 02:16.329
Chengming.

02:20.590 --> 02:21.560
Feiyan!

02:39.910 --> 02:40.800
Scam...

02:40.800 --> 02:41.630
Feiyan...

02:43.120 --> 02:45.430
This is a scam!

02:46.430 --> 02:47.360
Feiyan.

02:47.870 --> 02:50.280
This is all a scam!

02:50.630 --> 02:51.960
Jiang Feiyan!

02:54.150 --> 02:56.710
The whole thing is a scam!

02:59.840 --> 03:02.150
You are a jinx.

03:03.910 --> 03:06.240
You got

03:06.710 --> 03:09.070
the whole family killed.

03:58.590 --> 03:59.910
What took you so long?

05:51.270 --> 05:54.970
[A Prophet]

05:56.000 --> 05:57.909
[Episode 1]

05:59.260 --> 06:02.470
[Pangzhou]

06:27.920 --> 06:28.830
Master Hu.

06:29.330 --> 06:32.440
[Hu Guangyuan, Tianxiang Sect]

06:33.070 --> 06:34.400
Who are you, gentleman?

06:34.659 --> 06:36.120
"The founder left 3 treasures.

06:36.120 --> 06:38.250
All disciples got real inheritance."

06:41.190 --> 06:42.870
"Qian harmonizes with Kun,
with Li and Kan in balance.

06:42.870 --> 06:45.090
[Du Gui, Tianxiang Sect]

06:43.070 --> 06:44.980
Our fame spreads across every land."

06:44.980 --> 06:46.430
"Zhen, Xun, Gen, and Dui create the wind.

06:46.430 --> 06:48.270
We gather from all corners
to make our mark."

06:48.270 --> 06:48.830
You got

06:49.070 --> 06:50.070
all the passwords right.

06:50.070 --> 06:51.950
I am Mu Zilian's 33rd-generation disciple,

06:51.950 --> 06:52.630
Lyu Ruhui.

06:52.750 --> 06:53.920
Greetings, Master Hu.

06:53.920 --> 06:54.630
Good.

06:55.040 --> 06:55.770
Come with us.

07:04.520 --> 07:05.980
[Yaxin Grand Hotel]

07:11.720 --> 07:14.500
The place you arranged is really fancy,
Master Hu.

07:14.500 --> 07:16.260
This is a big job.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.950
I can't risk anything going wrong.

07:17.950 --> 07:18.720
So,

07:18.800 --> 07:20.040
sorry for the rough journey.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.640
It's our first time meeting,

07:21.680 --> 07:22.800
but I've heard

07:23.040 --> 07:24.750
a lot about you in Pujiang.

07:25.300 --> 07:25.900
Master Hu,

07:25.920 --> 07:27.240
you can ask me to do anything.

07:27.240 --> 07:28.390
I'm at your command.

07:28.920 --> 07:29.430
Master,

07:29.430 --> 07:30.390
the room is ready.

07:30.390 --> 07:30.950
Okay.

07:32.360 --> 07:32.950
This is Du Gui.

07:32.950 --> 07:34.240
He works for me.

07:34.360 --> 07:35.270
In terms of seniority,

07:35.270 --> 07:36.800
you should call him senior.

07:37.360 --> 07:38.040
Senior Gui.

07:38.790 --> 07:39.400
Gui,

07:39.430 --> 07:41.720
take Ruhui to the room to freshen up.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.920
You're in room 203.

07:44.310 --> 07:44.920
Okay.

07:46.159 --> 07:46.580
See you.

07:46.580 --> 07:47.040
See you.

08:10.910 --> 08:15.030
[Eight hours ago]

08:24.910 --> 08:26.350
What took you so long?

08:29.310 --> 08:30.630
Once we reach Pangzhou,

08:30.630 --> 08:31.360
Ruhui,

08:32.000 --> 08:33.630
are you going to do some big business?

08:33.630 --> 08:34.320
No rush.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.549
Once we reach Pangzhou,

08:35.549 --> 08:37.440
I'll first show you around,

08:37.510 --> 08:38.909
find a woman to get rid of the bad luck,

08:38.909 --> 08:40.120
and then get down to business.

08:40.120 --> 08:41.450
There's plenty of time.

08:41.549 --> 08:43.270
Your Tianxiang Sect is amazing.

08:43.270 --> 08:43.909
Ruhui,

08:44.440 --> 08:46.030
do you earn a lot of gold bars

08:46.440 --> 08:48.030
from every deal?

08:48.490 --> 08:52.550
[Lyu Ruhui, Tianxiang Sect]

08:50.080 --> 08:51.080
Remember,

08:51.270 --> 08:52.790
everyone in the Tianxiang Sect

08:52.790 --> 08:54.000
boasts the talent

08:54.030 --> 08:55.670
of a chancellor.

08:56.840 --> 08:57.840
Do you know

08:59.030 --> 09:00.240
what this is?

09:01.120 --> 09:01.720
Only

09:01.720 --> 09:02.670
the Batou

09:02.840 --> 09:03.910
can have this.

09:05.600 --> 09:06.840
What is "Batou"?

09:07.550 --> 09:08.600
A leader.

09:09.840 --> 09:12.570
Looks like I made the right choice
following you!

09:12.750 --> 09:13.960
During the trip to Pangzhou,

09:13.960 --> 09:16.070
you must keep your head clear.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.750
When I tell you to strike,

09:18.150 --> 09:19.150
be quick about it.

09:23.150 --> 09:23.870
Ruhui,

09:24.270 --> 09:25.510
didn't you tell me before that

09:25.510 --> 09:27.000
the Tianxiang Sect only tricks people

09:27.000 --> 09:27.670
but never kills them?

09:27.670 --> 09:29.630
Rules were set by our ancestors.

09:29.750 --> 09:31.150
If we never kill,

09:31.300 --> 09:33.900
the pittance we make
is barely enough to get by.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.120
You're right.

09:43.240 --> 09:43.960
Chengming,

09:44.200 --> 09:45.150
be careful.

09:46.070 --> 09:47.730
It's indeed not enough for me.

09:58.360 --> 10:00.150
This is just the beginning.

10:01.320 --> 10:02.580
I won't let a single one

10:03.480 --> 10:05.140
of the Tianxiang Sect escape.

10:45.820 --> 10:46.480
[Recorded by Lyu Ruhai]

10:59.650 --> 11:01.800
[Huangsha]

11:20.120 --> 11:21.000
Senior Gui,

11:21.840 --> 11:23.080
I've shaved.

11:26.870 --> 11:28.240
Just in case you didn't

11:28.750 --> 11:30.010
shave it clean enough,

11:31.080 --> 11:32.680
let me shave it for you again.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.810
Where did you come from?

11:37.440 --> 11:38.050
Pujiang.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.520
Which station did you get on the train at?

11:39.520 --> 11:40.390
Fanhuangdu Station.

11:40.390 --> 11:42.600
Why are there 2 tickets?

11:47.320 --> 11:48.510
Miss Lyu from Pujiang

11:48.510 --> 11:49.840
insisted on eloping with me.

11:49.840 --> 11:51.170
She bought the tickets.

11:51.180 --> 11:52.180
Where is she then?

11:52.440 --> 11:54.720
If I brought every girl who wanted

11:54.720 --> 11:56.030
to elope with me,

11:57.550 --> 11:59.550
how could I work for you, Senior Gui?

12:05.630 --> 12:06.750
Listen,

12:06.880 --> 12:08.760
I despise you pretty swindlers

12:08.790 --> 12:10.150
the most, you know?

12:10.150 --> 12:11.510
You gigolos

12:11.750 --> 12:12.750
elope with women and swindle them.

12:12.750 --> 12:14.350
What skills do you even have?

12:15.360 --> 12:16.070
Senior Gui,

12:17.440 --> 12:19.500
this actually requires some skills.

12:24.000 --> 12:25.260
The Philippine cigar—

12:25.670 --> 12:27.070
not as good as Cuban ones.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.720
I'll just make do with it.

12:53.900 --> 12:54.930
Made in Burgundy.

12:55.080 --> 12:56.340
You really spent a lot.

12:56.790 --> 12:57.630
However,

12:57.630 --> 13:00.000
this short, wide glass with a narrow rim
is called a cognac glass.

13:00.000 --> 13:01.320
It's meant for brandy.

13:01.750 --> 13:03.410
So it's a bit unconventional.

13:04.790 --> 13:06.030
Interesting.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.080
Fine feathers make

13:09.270 --> 13:10.240
fine birds.

13:11.480 --> 13:13.030
Go pick an outfit.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.770
There's a phone in the room.

13:27.080 --> 13:27.960
Call me

13:28.440 --> 13:29.720
if you need anything.

13:31.870 --> 13:32.600
Senior Gui,

13:33.530 --> 13:35.070
I know you don't like me,

13:35.720 --> 13:38.120
but we still
have to get along in the future.

13:38.390 --> 13:39.250
How about this?

13:39.550 --> 13:40.910
I'll treat you to dinner.

13:40.910 --> 13:41.790
Let's

13:42.030 --> 13:43.220
bury the hatchet.

13:44.670 --> 13:46.030
Save it.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.240
You should use that time

13:48.240 --> 13:49.550
to memorize the stuff.

13:49.750 --> 13:50.270
Also,

13:50.750 --> 13:51.780
you're not leaving here

13:51.780 --> 13:53.030
until you've memorized it properly,

13:53.030 --> 13:53.960
understand?

13:53.960 --> 13:54.790
No way.

13:55.150 --> 13:56.510
I've been holding back all the way.

13:56.510 --> 13:58.170
I need to go walk around first.

13:58.790 --> 13:59.510
Brat,

13:59.790 --> 14:00.360
listen.

14:01.030 --> 14:02.320
Don't get too big for your britches,

14:02.320 --> 14:03.240
understand?

14:04.000 --> 14:05.670
Gigolos like you are

14:05.870 --> 14:07.870
a dime a dozen in our Tianxiang Sect.

14:08.240 --> 14:10.030
If you screw things up,

14:10.390 --> 14:11.630
I'll kill you

14:11.870 --> 14:14.200
before my master
even has to give an order.

14:16.120 --> 14:17.790
We don't have much time left.

14:17.890 --> 14:20.100
[Chen Qingying]

14:18.120 --> 14:19.520
We've got only one night.

14:19.710 --> 14:21.790
You must memorize every single word

14:21.790 --> 14:22.720
on this.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.940
Whether this plan succeeds or not

14:25.150 --> 14:26.440
all depends on you.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.630
Congratulations, President Chen!

14:38.630 --> 14:39.830
Thank you, thank you.

14:39.840 --> 14:41.960
Thank you all for coming
to show your support.

14:41.960 --> 14:43.510
Thank you, thank you so much.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.670
President Chen!

14:46.200 --> 14:47.080
Director Zhao!

14:48.210 --> 14:49.180
President Chen.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.480
Congratulations

14:50.910 --> 14:52.550
on opening your new store!

14:52.960 --> 14:54.080
I'm just running a small business.

14:54.080 --> 14:56.610
I'll still need your support,
Director Zhao.

14:57.670 --> 14:59.270
If yours is a small business,

14:59.510 --> 15:02.510
then no one in Pangzhou City
would dare to do business.

15:04.270 --> 15:05.330
Where is Qingying?

15:07.150 --> 15:08.870
She was here just now.

15:29.110 --> 15:29.780
[Chen's Gold Shop]

15:43.360 --> 15:44.820
Congratulations, Daddy.

15:46.510 --> 15:47.270
Qingying!

15:47.270 --> 15:48.120
Hi, Mr. Zhao.

15:51.750 --> 15:52.790
I'll talk to you later, Mr. Zhao.

15:52.790 --> 15:53.320
Okay.

16:14.870 --> 16:16.200
Daddy.

16:17.530 --> 16:19.840
Get changed
and throw this suit away right now.

16:19.840 --> 16:21.240
A female university graduate

16:21.240 --> 16:22.790
from Cambridge hangs out

16:22.790 --> 16:24.840
with these low-class people every day.

16:24.840 --> 16:25.970
How inappropriate!

16:27.340 --> 16:29.820
Stop talking about upper class
and lower class all the time.

16:29.820 --> 16:31.180
Abraham Lincoln said,

16:31.370 --> 16:32.970
"All men are created equal."

16:34.010 --> 16:36.660
If you were a boy,
I wouldn't even bother with you.

16:36.660 --> 16:38.930
But you are my only daughter.

16:39.090 --> 16:39.960
If you keep this up,

16:39.960 --> 16:41.620
who's ever going to marry you?

16:43.510 --> 16:44.360
Daddy,

16:44.750 --> 16:46.750
do you really want me to get married?

16:47.490 --> 16:49.080
What nonsense are you talking about?

16:49.080 --> 16:49.840
A grown-up girl

16:49.840 --> 16:51.460
has to get married, of course.

16:51.460 --> 16:52.670
If I get married,

16:52.990 --> 16:54.300
our gold shops,

16:54.600 --> 16:55.390
pawnshops,

16:56.010 --> 16:56.790
and restaurants

16:56.790 --> 16:58.590
will all belong to someone else.

16:59.350 --> 17:01.740
That's why I can only
take in a live-in son-in-law,

17:01.740 --> 17:04.670
and every son you have
must take the Chen family name!

17:06.200 --> 17:06.680
Okay!

17:07.150 --> 17:09.010
I'll go find one for you right now.

17:11.040 --> 17:11.619
Where are you going?

17:11.619 --> 17:12.480
Come back here!

17:12.640 --> 17:14.240
I'm going to return the suit.

17:22.160 --> 17:22.880
Mr. Lin,

17:23.160 --> 17:24.640
here is the newspaper you ordered.

17:24.640 --> 17:25.310
Thank you.

17:32.070 --> 17:34.590
[Lin Shengxiang
arrived in Suicheng yesterday.]

17:37.000 --> 17:38.000
Okay, I got it.

17:40.310 --> 17:40.680
Okay.

17:41.790 --> 17:42.400
That's it.

17:43.870 --> 17:44.330
Master.

17:47.790 --> 17:48.590
What's wrong?

17:50.030 --> 17:51.110
I mean, look at you.

17:52.350 --> 17:54.410
Why are your looks so disappointing?

17:54.830 --> 17:56.550
If you were even a bit decent-looking,

17:56.550 --> 17:59.480
I wouldn't have
had to get someone here from Pujiang.

17:59.510 --> 18:00.270
Thankfully,

18:01.030 --> 18:02.590
he looks quite quick-witted.

18:02.590 --> 18:04.720
Well, it's not my fault how I look.

18:04.880 --> 18:06.200
Then whose fault is it?

18:06.440 --> 18:08.750
Why didn't you take after your mother?

18:09.030 --> 18:09.750
Fine, fine.

18:10.320 --> 18:11.910
Just blame it on my disappointing looks.

18:11.910 --> 18:13.300
You said he's quick-witted.

18:13.300 --> 18:14.430
But I don't think so.

18:14.550 --> 18:15.480
I think this brat

18:16.230 --> 18:17.030
is a bit fishy.

18:17.550 --> 18:19.350
He gave all the right passwords.

18:19.480 --> 18:21.160
The token is also real.

18:21.840 --> 18:23.880
But I still can't feel at ease.

18:24.200 --> 18:25.060
How about this?

18:25.270 --> 18:26.670
I'll send them a telegram

18:26.680 --> 18:28.210
to confirm, just to be safe.

18:28.510 --> 18:29.310
Don't bother.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.830
After we wrap up this job,

18:31.830 --> 18:32.750
he'll be gone.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.310
Gone?

18:35.970 --> 18:37.720
Isn't he your junior's disciple?

18:37.720 --> 18:39.400
Your looks are disappointing,

18:39.400 --> 18:41.440
so is your brain.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.750
"Different branches, different ties."

18:43.750 --> 18:45.610
Haven't you heard of this saying?

18:45.910 --> 18:49.240
Isn't it good to have one less person
to share the money with?

18:50.830 --> 18:51.590
Master,

18:51.590 --> 18:52.400
you are really wicked.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.200
Master Hu.

18:54.480 --> 18:55.200
Long time no see.

18:55.200 --> 18:55.920
Long time no see,

18:55.920 --> 18:56.640
Mr. Lin.

18:56.850 --> 18:58.050
Welcome to Pangzhou.

18:59.690 --> 19:00.110
Alright,

19:00.110 --> 19:01.200
everything is ready.

19:01.200 --> 19:02.330
Go with your senior.

19:02.550 --> 19:02.920
Okay.

19:03.240 --> 19:03.770
Let's go.

19:08.460 --> 19:10.060
What's wrong with your eyes?

19:12.510 --> 19:13.770
Keep a close eye on him!

19:18.070 --> 19:19.880
What did I do to deserve this?

19:28.680 --> 19:30.010
Every Wednesday night,

19:30.140 --> 19:31.940
Miss Chen comes to this bar

19:32.200 --> 19:35.600
and orders a special brandy
as well as a portion of fried fish,

19:36.070 --> 19:37.510
because her favorite band

19:37.510 --> 19:39.000
only performs on Wednesday nights.

19:39.000 --> 19:41.350
The band
finishes their performance at 9 PM.

19:41.350 --> 19:43.350
Miss Chen always comes secretly

19:43.510 --> 19:44.790
behind her father's back.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.570
She comes and goes by a rickshaw.

19:46.570 --> 19:48.460
From here to her house,

19:48.480 --> 19:50.480
she has to pass through 3 blocks.

19:50.510 --> 19:53.000
Our men will lie in ambush
on Shamo Street in advance

19:53.000 --> 19:54.790
and act immediately once we spot her.

19:54.790 --> 19:56.050
Your mission this time

19:56.240 --> 19:57.960
is to rescue Chen Qingying

19:58.200 --> 19:59.920
from our men.

20:00.310 --> 20:01.310
You'll be doing great.

20:01.310 --> 20:03.070
As the son of a rich businessman
in San Francisco

20:03.070 --> 20:04.790
and her savior,

20:06.640 --> 20:07.810
you can take

20:07.830 --> 20:09.240
this first step easily.

20:09.350 --> 20:09.810
Come on.

20:09.920 --> 20:11.650
Saving the damsel in distress—

20:11.720 --> 20:12.400
how cliché.

20:12.910 --> 20:13.840
What do you mean?

20:13.870 --> 20:15.000
Just say your lines!

20:27.960 --> 20:29.090
Where are you going?

20:38.590 --> 20:39.110
Hello.

20:47.560 --> 20:49.160
Someone hired me
for 100 silver dollars a day

20:49.160 --> 20:50.420
to make you fall for me.

20:51.590 --> 20:52.680
This opening line

20:52.860 --> 20:53.820
is new to me.

20:54.030 --> 20:54.630
It's real.

20:55.120 --> 20:55.630
And

20:55.790 --> 20:56.590
I took the job.

20:57.780 --> 20:58.430
Miss Chen,

20:59.550 --> 21:00.480
do you need help?

21:04.020 --> 21:05.250
One special brandy

21:05.540 --> 21:06.300
and one fried fish.

21:06.300 --> 21:06.610
Okay.

21:06.610 --> 21:07.410
Two brandies.

21:11.070 --> 21:11.870
Just a moment.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.000
So how do you plan to court me?

21:18.110 --> 21:18.840
I don't know.

21:19.240 --> 21:19.920
We could

21:20.160 --> 21:21.110
first go shopping,

21:21.110 --> 21:21.750
see an opera,

21:21.750 --> 21:22.440
watch a movie,

21:22.440 --> 21:23.160
and then

21:23.510 --> 21:24.430
meet your parents.

21:24.430 --> 21:25.360
That's too slow.

21:25.500 --> 21:26.840
Why not just meet my parents directly?

21:26.840 --> 21:27.580
That works, too.

21:27.580 --> 21:29.170
My family has a lot of rules.

21:29.450 --> 21:30.480
You can only be my matrilocal husband.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.140
No problem.

21:31.300 --> 21:32.690
We can have 2 children.

21:32.850 --> 21:33.720
The first one takes your surname,

21:33.720 --> 21:34.540
and the second one takes mine.

21:34.540 --> 21:35.300
No way.

21:36.350 --> 21:38.080
They must both take my surname.

21:39.920 --> 21:41.580
I suppose I can live with that.

21:43.330 --> 21:44.860
You're quite interesting.

21:45.980 --> 21:47.910
If I had asked you to leave just now,

21:48.110 --> 21:50.910
you wouldn't have had the chance
to say these, huh?

21:51.830 --> 21:53.290
I would've had the chance.

21:53.650 --> 21:55.820
We'd hire a few men
to ambush you on the way.

21:55.820 --> 21:57.400
Once they get you under control,

21:57.400 --> 21:58.440
I'd swoop in

21:58.720 --> 22:00.480
and take them all down.

22:00.750 --> 22:01.440
After that,

22:01.680 --> 22:02.480
you'd believe

22:02.680 --> 22:03.540
whatever I say.

22:05.030 --> 22:06.760
Saving the damsel in distress?

22:07.200 --> 22:08.110
What a cliché.

22:09.960 --> 22:11.160
It is a bit of a cliché.

22:11.720 --> 22:12.640
However,

22:14.270 --> 22:16.640
there are always some fools
who will buy it.

22:16.640 --> 22:17.920
Let me tell you a story.

22:23.310 --> 22:25.590
Listen, you need
to understand your father.

22:25.590 --> 22:26.590
He's getting old.

22:26.590 --> 22:28.400
Of course, he wants you
to inherit the family business,

22:28.400 --> 22:28.960
right?

22:29.110 --> 22:31.550
I studied architecture abroad,
not business.

22:31.550 --> 22:33.590
I've always looked up
to Mr. Liang as my role model.

22:33.590 --> 22:34.550
Chinese learning as the base,

22:34.550 --> 22:35.910
Western learning for application.

22:35.910 --> 22:36.810
I hope my life...

22:36.810 --> 22:37.410
Yes,

22:37.590 --> 22:39.030
you studied abroad and returned

22:39.030 --> 22:40.350
with a degree in architecture.

22:40.350 --> 22:40.750
Right?

22:40.880 --> 22:41.880
This and inheriting

22:41.880 --> 22:43.400
your family's silk business

22:43.400 --> 22:44.440
don't conflict at all.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.640
They don't conflict? How?

22:45.640 --> 22:46.880
Do you know how many people

22:46.880 --> 22:48.740
envy you for having such a father?

22:53.550 --> 22:56.000
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

22:56.880 --> 23:21.890
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

23:20.920 --> 23:23.720
-Nice!
-Bravo!

23:28.750 --> 23:29.310
Sir.

23:32.030 --> 23:33.200
Did you get someone else

23:33.200 --> 23:34.310
to play Liang Hongyu?

23:34.310 --> 23:34.790
Yes.

23:35.240 --> 23:36.590
The previous one's voice changed.

23:36.590 --> 23:37.640
This is the new performer.

23:37.310 --> 23:55.470
♪ She sees one man off
only to welcome another every day ♪

23:37.920 --> 23:39.030
Her stage name is Feiyan.

23:39.030 --> 23:41.290
Her figure and voice are both excellent.

23:41.310 --> 23:43.270
The manager let her fill in
for a couple of shows.

23:43.270 --> 23:44.530
When this show is over,

23:45.550 --> 23:47.590
send 2 flower baskets
to the backstage for me.

23:47.590 --> 23:48.850
Don't mention my name.

23:49.110 --> 23:49.680
Got it.

23:50.030 --> 23:51.290
Please enjoy it, sirs.

23:54.070 --> 23:57.160
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

24:01.270 --> 24:01.920
Go back!

24:01.920 --> 24:03.030
What do you want?

24:03.110 --> 24:03.640
Help!

24:03.640 --> 24:05.400
We are a bit cash-strapped.

24:05.400 --> 24:07.240
We just want to borrow
some money from you.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.310
If you don't have any,

24:08.310 --> 24:10.030
then we'll borrow something else.

24:10.030 --> 24:11.360
What are you doing here?

24:13.920 --> 24:15.270
It's none of your business.

24:15.270 --> 24:15.880
Get lost!

24:20.110 --> 24:22.510
Aren't you the one
who played Liang Hongyu?

24:24.690 --> 24:26.340
If she is "Liang Hongyu,"

24:26.890 --> 24:28.820
then you must be "Han Shizhong."

24:30.150 --> 24:32.350
You want to marry this bitch

24:32.740 --> 24:34.940
and let her sing for you in bed every day,

24:34.960 --> 24:35.550
right?

24:36.750 --> 24:37.750
What a pity.

24:39.240 --> 24:40.640
Before the wedding,

24:41.180 --> 24:43.240
I have to hold a funeral for you first.

24:43.480 --> 24:43.960
Boss,

24:44.400 --> 24:44.920
boss,

24:45.540 --> 24:47.540
we are all making a living.

24:47.680 --> 24:48.880
Sorry for the offense.

24:48.880 --> 24:50.030
Run! Run quickly!

24:56.880 --> 24:57.610
Are you okay?

25:00.400 --> 25:01.240
This is fake.

25:02.000 --> 25:04.060
A toy I bought for my younger brother.

25:05.000 --> 25:05.720
Then please

25:06.070 --> 25:06.880
put it away.

25:08.480 --> 25:09.080
By the way,

25:09.820 --> 25:11.820
did you receive the flower baskets?

25:12.960 --> 25:13.640
I sent them.

25:21.110 --> 25:22.510
So were those hooligans

25:22.750 --> 25:24.150
really hired by that man?

25:24.680 --> 25:25.680
Maybe they were

25:26.000 --> 25:27.310
hired by that woman.

25:28.750 --> 25:29.890
A woman

25:29.920 --> 25:31.550
had someone harass her.

25:32.220 --> 25:34.550
What if the man
didn't show up and save her?

25:34.590 --> 25:36.190
Wouldn't she end up in a bind?

25:36.410 --> 25:37.450
If this woman had

25:37.770 --> 25:40.350
investigated
this man thoroughly beforehand,

25:40.350 --> 25:41.960
there would've been no "what if."

25:41.960 --> 25:43.090
What happened next?

25:43.600 --> 25:44.280
Next...

25:49.240 --> 25:50.170
Happy birthday.

25:53.400 --> 25:53.920
You...

25:55.590 --> 25:57.190
How did you know my birthday?

25:57.350 --> 25:58.830
I have my ways.

26:02.350 --> 26:03.350
This is

26:03.640 --> 26:04.900
the first time someone

26:05.640 --> 26:07.370
made longevity noodles for me.

26:08.440 --> 26:09.700
Because no one has ever

26:10.480 --> 26:12.880
celebrated my birthday since I was little.

26:14.070 --> 26:14.830
Thank you.

26:16.350 --> 26:18.210
My father died an untimely death.

26:18.350 --> 26:19.680
I grew up with my mother.

26:20.830 --> 26:21.830
My mother has been

26:22.750 --> 26:24.150
seriously ill for years.

26:24.720 --> 26:27.270
We've seen many doctors,
but none could cure her.

26:27.270 --> 26:28.030
Therefore,

26:28.880 --> 26:31.000
no one could spare a thought
for things like this.

26:31.000 --> 26:33.000
What illness does your mother have?

26:33.160 --> 26:35.680
Some of my classmates
study Western medicine.

26:35.680 --> 26:37.510
I can have them consult on her case.

26:37.510 --> 26:38.640
It won't help.

26:39.680 --> 26:40.550
I once

26:41.070 --> 26:43.200
ran into an old gentleman surnamed Du.

26:43.680 --> 26:44.640
He told me that

26:45.640 --> 26:46.790
my mother fell ill

26:47.480 --> 26:48.590
all because of me,

26:49.350 --> 26:51.680
and I was a born jinx, bringing misfortune

26:51.790 --> 26:53.750
to my parents, relatives, friends,

26:53.750 --> 26:54.950
and my devoted lover.

26:55.720 --> 26:56.520
In a nutshell,

26:56.720 --> 26:58.250
everyone who treats me well

26:58.720 --> 26:59.550
will end up

27:00.030 --> 27:01.200
dead because of me.

27:01.570 --> 27:02.880
That's utter nonsense.

27:02.880 --> 27:03.750
It's all true.

27:04.140 --> 27:04.820
Moreover,

27:05.000 --> 27:06.550
Mr. Du also told me that

27:07.400 --> 27:09.460
the only way to get rid of this bad luck

27:10.480 --> 27:12.280
was to remain unmarried for life

27:12.400 --> 27:14.400
and work in the lowest professions—

27:14.640 --> 27:16.640
I should either be a lowly performer

27:17.480 --> 27:18.160
or...

27:20.510 --> 27:21.550
Or be a whore.

27:21.720 --> 27:22.920
Where is that old guy?

27:23.480 --> 27:24.940
I'll go find him right now!

27:24.960 --> 27:26.960
Mr. Du wanders all over the country.

27:27.110 --> 27:28.170
You can't find him.

27:28.720 --> 27:29.550
But

27:29.750 --> 27:31.310
since I started trying this method,

27:31.310 --> 27:32.510
my mother's indeed been

27:32.510 --> 27:34.030
taking a turn for the better.

27:34.030 --> 27:34.920
So this really works.

27:34.920 --> 27:35.980
Don't believe him.

27:36.310 --> 27:38.200
These fortune tellers all talk nonsense.

27:38.200 --> 27:39.880
Why should performers
who play miserable people

27:39.880 --> 27:41.440
be considered the lowliest?

27:41.440 --> 27:42.070
I actually think

27:42.070 --> 27:43.600
they've got real backbone.

27:44.310 --> 27:44.720
Well,

27:45.360 --> 27:46.620
take me to your mother,

27:47.260 --> 27:49.060
and I'll take her to see a doctor.

27:49.200 --> 27:50.060
How about that?

27:54.070 --> 27:55.400
It's all superstition.

27:56.110 --> 27:57.680
Birth, aging, illness, and death

27:57.680 --> 27:59.400
are part of the natural order.

27:59.830 --> 28:02.790
Those who describe a pretty woman
as the source of disaster

28:02.790 --> 28:03.720
are mostly

28:03.750 --> 28:05.750
miserable and pathetic themselves

28:05.750 --> 28:07.680
and can't stand seeing others do well.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.750
Everyone

28:09.160 --> 28:10.890
has something they believe in.

28:11.350 --> 28:12.960
It could be gods or Buddhas,

28:13.640 --> 28:15.880
money or power.

28:16.960 --> 28:17.820
What about you?

28:18.510 --> 28:19.510
What do you believe in?

28:19.510 --> 28:20.640
I believe in myself.

28:23.380 --> 28:24.110
That's nice.

28:25.480 --> 28:26.750
So, were those two people

28:26.750 --> 28:28.210
going to fall in love next?

28:30.960 --> 28:32.020
It's getting late.

28:32.640 --> 28:34.840
Your parents must be worried about you.

28:36.790 --> 28:37.850
It's this late now?

28:40.480 --> 28:43.540
I got so caught up in your story
that I lost track of time.

28:43.680 --> 28:44.940
Let me escort you home.

28:45.590 --> 28:46.390
Don't bother.

29:03.030 --> 29:03.880
My lady.

29:07.200 --> 29:09.060
You're quite a good storyteller.

29:09.110 --> 29:11.240
I'll tell you more if there's a chance.

29:27.790 --> 29:29.640
You came back so late again.

29:30.200 --> 29:31.920
As a young lady,

29:32.030 --> 29:33.510
you go to bars every night

29:33.510 --> 29:34.710
and come back so late.

29:35.120 --> 29:36.280
If anything happens to you,

29:36.280 --> 29:38.210
how will you ever get married then?

29:39.320 --> 29:40.670
Come on.

29:41.640 --> 29:43.500
What could possibly happen to me?

29:44.140 --> 29:45.790
You reek of alcohol!

29:46.100 --> 29:48.100
Who were you drinking with tonight?

29:49.550 --> 29:50.080
With him.

29:55.880 --> 29:59.810
Lin Shengxiang, the son of a leader
in the overseas Chinese community?

30:04.990 --> 30:07.250
I can stab you to death.
Do you believe it?

30:07.250 --> 30:07.930
Master,

30:07.960 --> 30:09.790
you told me to keep a close eye on him.

30:09.790 --> 30:11.310
I watched him like a hawk.

30:11.570 --> 30:12.700
But this bastard

30:12.720 --> 30:14.580
didn't stick to the script at all!

30:15.110 --> 30:16.440
Ouch! It Hurts!

30:18.400 --> 30:19.030
Gui.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.070
Having you around

30:21.200 --> 30:23.110
will take years off my life.

30:24.220 --> 30:24.570
What?

30:27.720 --> 30:28.400
Answer me.

30:29.100 --> 30:30.750
Why did you act on your own?

30:31.270 --> 30:33.130
If I had done what you told me to do,

30:33.310 --> 30:34.630
the whole plan would be screwed up.

30:34.630 --> 30:35.410
Do you really think

30:35.410 --> 30:37.550
a rich heiress
wouldn't have bodyguards with her

30:37.550 --> 30:39.210
when she goes to a bar at night?

30:40.550 --> 30:41.950
Do you know her that well?

30:42.310 --> 30:44.750
I sleep with that book
in my arms every night!

30:44.750 --> 30:46.480
No one knows her better than me!

30:50.590 --> 30:52.240
Let go.

30:54.750 --> 30:55.400
Get up.

30:59.170 --> 31:00.130
This brat

31:00.790 --> 31:02.790
simply got dumb luck.

31:03.470 --> 31:04.470
He has no brains.

31:04.610 --> 31:06.420
That woman is even crazier than him!

31:06.420 --> 31:08.750
He has more brains than you.

31:08.970 --> 31:10.860
Since the very first day
you started working for me,

31:10.860 --> 31:12.140
I've told you

31:12.170 --> 31:14.780
to strike fast and con patiently.

31:14.960 --> 31:16.820
He hit the mark in the first place.

31:17.090 --> 31:19.200
No matter how he cons
Chen Qingying afterwards,

31:19.200 --> 31:20.960
she won't suspect him anymore.

31:25.480 --> 31:26.110
Kid,

31:26.620 --> 31:27.880
you did well this time.

31:27.950 --> 31:28.580
However,

31:28.750 --> 31:29.920
if you dare to act

31:30.310 --> 31:31.950
without permission again,

31:32.470 --> 31:33.920
I'll skin you alive.

31:37.000 --> 31:37.640
Master,

31:37.790 --> 31:39.270
our plan is already ruined now.

31:39.270 --> 31:40.440
What should we do next?

31:40.440 --> 31:41.590
You can't set up a chance encounter

31:41.590 --> 31:42.850
for them again, right?

31:43.510 --> 31:44.840
Don't worry about that.

31:45.920 --> 31:46.750
She will

31:49.030 --> 31:50.830
definitely contact me in 3 days.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.110
Coming.

32:20.030 --> 32:20.640
Hi.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.590
Miss Chen?

32:25.790 --> 32:26.990
What brings you here?

32:27.640 --> 32:28.240
What?

32:28.790 --> 32:29.990
Am I not welcome here?

32:30.310 --> 32:31.920
Coming to see me so openly,
aren't you afraid

32:31.920 --> 32:33.050
someone will see us?

32:33.400 --> 32:34.260
Are you afraid?

32:34.270 --> 32:35.160
Why would I be?

32:35.890 --> 32:38.020
I'm hired for 100 silver dollars a day.

32:38.130 --> 32:38.990
How about this?

32:39.720 --> 32:41.570
Give me half your remuneration,

32:41.930 --> 32:43.240
and I promise I won't tell anyone.

32:43.240 --> 32:44.400
You can have it all.

32:45.260 --> 32:45.850
What's the plan?

32:45.850 --> 32:48.560
Are we going shopping
or going to the opera today?

32:48.560 --> 32:49.560
Didn't I tell you?

32:49.820 --> 32:52.070
We're going to meet my parents directly.

32:52.070 --> 32:52.600
Let's go.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.000
Come home with me.

32:57.510 --> 32:58.100
Mr. Lin,

32:58.510 --> 33:01.510
is our food to your liking?

33:02.070 --> 33:03.130
Hometown food made

33:03.270 --> 33:04.940
in your hometown tastes the best.

33:04.940 --> 33:06.790
I couldn't get the same flavor
where I used to live.

33:06.790 --> 33:09.190
It always felt like something was missing.

33:10.340 --> 33:11.880
Qingying felt the same as you.

33:11.880 --> 33:14.110
Back when she was studying in England,

33:14.450 --> 33:16.800
she always missed our homemade food

33:16.820 --> 33:18.080
and craved this taste.

33:20.880 --> 33:21.550
Mr. Lin,

33:22.000 --> 33:24.880
which school did you attend in America?

33:27.180 --> 33:27.820
MIT.

33:28.310 --> 33:29.000
Pardon?

33:31.640 --> 33:32.470
MIT.

33:33.780 --> 33:34.730
That's a good school.

33:34.730 --> 33:35.840
Pretty good.

33:37.070 --> 33:39.630
What are you planning to do
this time you're back?

33:39.630 --> 33:40.830
To be honest with you,

33:40.960 --> 33:42.620
I'm planning to buy a tin mine.

33:43.270 --> 33:43.930
For mining?

33:45.860 --> 33:47.460
The mining business is

33:47.740 --> 33:48.940
pretty complicated.

33:49.650 --> 33:50.890
You are new here.

33:50.980 --> 33:52.000
If you run into any difficulties,

33:52.000 --> 33:53.520
just feel free to tell me.

33:53.550 --> 33:55.480
I will do whatever I can to help you.

33:56.070 --> 33:56.930
Thank you, sir.

33:57.370 --> 33:58.890
But my father told me

33:59.310 --> 34:00.510
to find

34:00.540 --> 34:02.070
a remarkable feng shui master—

34:02.070 --> 34:02.720
Mr. Song,

34:03.010 --> 34:04.250
Song Tiezui—

34:04.550 --> 34:06.810
and follow his advice on buying the mine.

34:07.200 --> 34:08.670
I've never heard of the need for a master

34:08.670 --> 34:10.330
when it comes to buying a mine.

34:10.710 --> 34:11.360
Yeah,

34:11.360 --> 34:12.090
Shengxiang.

34:12.320 --> 34:14.050
As one of the young generation,

34:14.090 --> 34:16.730
do you also believe in feng shui?

34:20.030 --> 34:21.190
My father said that

34:22.150 --> 34:23.760
he asked this master

34:24.150 --> 34:25.210
to change his fate,

34:26.920 --> 34:29.580
and that was how he came to have
today's fortune.

34:31.460 --> 34:33.250
"Song Tiezui"?

34:34.960 --> 34:36.960
How come I've never heard

34:37.320 --> 34:39.480
of such a person in Pangzhou before?

34:39.710 --> 34:40.760
Mr. Song is

34:40.830 --> 34:42.139
incredibly elusive.

34:42.230 --> 34:44.550
I only came here
because I heard he showed up

34:44.550 --> 34:45.440
in Pangzhou.

34:47.590 --> 34:48.480
Good.

34:49.800 --> 34:50.400
By the way,

34:50.710 --> 34:51.440
Shengxiang,

34:51.670 --> 34:53.400
just let Qingying show you

34:53.420 --> 34:56.170
around Pangzhou
for the next couple of days.

34:56.440 --> 34:58.110
All the prominent figures here

34:58.110 --> 34:59.440
are my friends.

34:59.440 --> 35:02.100
If you have any questions,
feel free to ask them.

35:04.200 --> 35:05.950
Then I'll take you up on that, sir.

35:05.950 --> 35:06.430
Good.

35:13.180 --> 35:13.780
Come on.

35:13.970 --> 35:14.670
Let's eat up.

35:14.670 --> 35:15.070
Okay.

35:15.920 --> 35:16.710
Your mother?

35:17.230 --> 35:18.960
I just said that
in the heat of the moment.

35:18.960 --> 35:20.010
Chen Jiarong asked me

35:20.010 --> 35:22.030
why I came to Pangzhou alone
without anyone to look after me.

35:22.030 --> 35:22.360
I...

35:22.420 --> 35:23.790
I just blurted out without thinking

35:23.790 --> 35:25.250
that my mom was coming tomorrow.

35:25.250 --> 35:26.760
Never thought that Miss Chen

35:26.760 --> 35:27.670
would offer to play host

35:27.670 --> 35:29.280
and hold a banquet for us
on behalf of the Chens.

35:29.280 --> 35:30.480
I was afraid that if I refused,

35:30.480 --> 35:32.190
she and her father would get suspicious.

35:32.190 --> 35:32.750
Wait,

35:33.000 --> 35:33.880
tomorrow?

35:34.030 --> 35:35.000
Where do you expect me

35:35.000 --> 35:37.130
to find one for you in such a short time?

35:37.310 --> 35:39.190
Master Hu, as omnipotent as you are,

35:39.190 --> 35:41.320
it shouldn't be too hard for you to find

35:41.320 --> 35:42.760
an old lady
to put on a show with me, right?

35:42.760 --> 35:44.690
Alright, enough, stop massaging.

35:47.190 --> 35:48.150
This is the first

35:48.880 --> 35:50.340
and last time I'll do this.

35:50.970 --> 35:52.410
Let's get this straight first.

35:52.410 --> 35:54.240
It costs money to find someone to do it.

35:54.240 --> 35:56.190
The expense will come out of your pay.

35:56.190 --> 35:56.960
As it should!

35:57.590 --> 35:59.390
Your mother is coming tomorrow?

35:59.450 --> 36:00.800
Why are you only telling me now?

36:00.800 --> 36:02.230
She was traveling in Pujiang

36:02.230 --> 36:03.840
and suddenly asked to visit me.

36:03.840 --> 36:04.840
Probably because

36:05.030 --> 36:06.440
she was bored being alone.

36:06.440 --> 36:07.570
That's a good thing.

36:07.850 --> 36:08.990
Since you're in Pangzhou,

36:08.990 --> 36:10.590
I'll make the arrangements.

36:10.760 --> 36:11.420
How about we

36:11.580 --> 36:13.360
invite your mother for dinner tomorrow?

36:13.360 --> 36:13.920
Okay.

36:14.590 --> 36:15.590
See you tomorrow.

36:15.630 --> 36:16.630
See you tomorrow.

36:24.360 --> 36:26.620
We're already shorthanded in Pangzhou,

36:26.630 --> 36:28.290
and he needs this so urgently.

36:28.660 --> 36:30.110
Good thing the old madam hasn't left.

36:30.110 --> 36:32.110
We can have her fill in temporarily.

36:32.150 --> 36:33.230
This Lyu Ruhui

36:33.440 --> 36:34.700
keeps messing around.

36:35.070 --> 36:36.360
After we wrap up this job,

36:36.360 --> 36:38.000
let's get rid of him immediately

36:38.000 --> 36:39.730
in case he causes more trouble.

36:52.350 --> 36:56.260
♪ Han Shizhong ♪

36:57.280 --> 37:01.770
♪ Fell from power ♪

37:03.960 --> 37:11.270
♪ with his ambition unfulfilled ♪

37:18.130 --> 37:20.320
♪ He ran into... ♪

37:21.190 --> 37:24.190
You must be the young man
recommended by Hu Guangyuan.

37:24.510 --> 37:26.240
Have you memorized your lines?

37:26.610 --> 37:27.730
Don't get cold feet

37:27.750 --> 37:28.840
at the last minute

37:28.840 --> 37:30.230
and ruin the show.

37:41.070 --> 37:42.400
It's been so many years.

37:43.150 --> 37:44.320
I missed you so much.

37:48.590 --> 37:49.290
Mother.

38:00.930 --> 38:04.430
[Old Madam Zhu, Tianxiang Sect]

38:12.240 --> 38:14.130
[In the next episode]

38:14.650 --> 38:15.320
Young Master,

38:15.320 --> 38:16.320
Jialiang and Jiashu

38:16.320 --> 38:17.190
are missing.

38:17.440 --> 38:17.960
What?

38:18.150 --> 38:18.960
Jialiang!

38:19.360 --> 38:19.920
Jiashu!

38:19.920 --> 38:20.630
Jialiang!

38:20.960 --> 38:21.920
Jiashu!

38:22.760 --> 38:23.480
Jialiang!

38:24.030 --> 38:24.760
Jiashu!

38:25.000 --> 38:25.590
Sir,

38:26.150 --> 38:27.440
you must save them.

38:27.880 --> 38:30.070
I'm willing to give up my family business

38:30.070 --> 38:31.230
and my everything

38:32.030 --> 38:33.290
to renovate the temple

38:34.000 --> 38:35.800
and rebuild the gold-leaf statue

38:35.800 --> 38:36.800
for the Immortal Elder!
